  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.4.1 hardens ReadAlignedCode at inaccessible memory-page boundaries, adds PID plus creation-time checks for remote memory mutation, Hook installation and module load/unload, and stabilizes failed-unhook regression tests. Public APIs, pinned native libmem and Windows x64/x86 / .NET 8 support remain unchanged. Identity preflights do not eliminate the check-to-use race in native PID-only calls. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.4.1 修复 ReadAlignedCode 在不可访问内存页边界的读取问题，增强远程内存修改、Hook 安装及模块加载/卸载的 PID 与创建时间身份校验，并稳定卸载 Hook 失败路径测试。保持公共 API、固定 native libmem 和 Windows x64/x86 / .NET 8 支持不变；预检查无法彻底消除原生 PID 操作的竞态。Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/docs/releases/v2.4.1.md",
